<h2 dir="auto">Pick your projects</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>In the dashboard's sidebar, each project now has a tick. All are ticked by default; untick the ones you don't want, and every figure, chart and projection adds up the ticked ones only.</li>
<li>Hover a project and click <strong>Only</strong> to look at it alone. <strong>All projects</strong> ticks everything again.</li>
<li>The MRR goal shows when all projects are ticked, since it's about the whole business.</li>
</ul>
